   24-pound shot    ratio  2.87: range at 45 degrees, formula    2826 m, integration    3778 m (-25%); best elevation, formula 32.3, integration 33.5
   trebuchet stone  ratio  0.32: range at 45 degrees, formula     224 m, integration     236 m (-5%); best elevation, formula 44.3, integration 44.5
   shuttlecock      ratio  8.82: range at 45 degrees, formula       9 m, integration      12 m (-23%); best elevation, formula 25.4, integration 26.0
